{"sentences":[{"id":"s_work_clt_173_1","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"一、二十有三年，春，王二月，癸酉，朔，日有食之。","sentenceOrder":1},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_2","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"二、三月，己巳，杞伯匄卒。","sentenceOrder":2},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_3","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"三、夏，邾畀我來奔。","sentenceOrder":3},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_4","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"四、葬杞孝公。","sentenceOrder":4},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_5","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"五、陳殺其大夫慶虎及慶寅。","sentenceOrder":5},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_6","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"稱國以殺，罪累上也。及慶寅，慶寅累也。","sentenceOrder":6},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_7","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"六、陳侯之弟光自楚歸於陳。","sentenceOrder":7},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_8","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"七、晉欒盈復入於晉，入於曲沃。","sentenceOrder":8},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_9","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"八、秋，齊侯伐衞，遂伐晉。","sentenceOrder":9},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_10","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"九、八月，叔孫豹帥師救晉，次於雍渝。","sentenceOrder":10},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_11","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"言救後次，非救也。","sentenceOrder":11},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_12","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"十、己卯，仲孫速卒。","sentenceOrder":12},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_13","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"十一、冬，十月，乙亥，臧孫紇出奔邾。","sentenceOrder":13},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_14","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"其日，正臧孫紇之出也。蘧伯玉曰：「不以道事其君者，其出乎！」","sentenceOrder":14},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_15","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"十二、晉人殺欒盈。","sentenceOrder":15},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_16","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"惡之，弗有也。","sentenceOrder":16},{"id":"s_work_clt_173_17","chapterId":"ch_work_clt_173","textTraditional":"十三、齊侯襲莒。","sentenceOrder":17}],"overrides":{}}